    <sectiondef kind="user-defined">
      <header>VCCIO source selection</header>
      <description><para>Kria HPC bank can be connected to either FMC2-LA00..19 (SW1002.2 Off) or FMC1-HA00..19 (SW1002.2 On) via DIP-Switch on the carrier board. Kria HDB bank is always connected to FMC2-LA20..31. It can be sourced with either FMC2-Vadj or 2.5V. With 2.5V LVDS-inputs are supported. Be carefull to make the correct settings for your FMC module. </para>
</description>
