    <sectiondef kind="user-defined">
      <header>Clock generator configuration</header>
      <description><para>Primarily used to provide reference clocks for the GTR transceivers and the ethernet PHY.</para>
<para>OUT6 (25 MHz CMOS PHY clock) is fixed and always enabled.</para>
<para>Use <ref refid="si5332_8h_1ae01f6fbfccb35d0dc46fb4ba3d43188ba9713633ae89a66c75c9d1533de513873" kindref="member">SI5332_CLK_SRC_XTAL_27M</ref> when no synchronization to the Sync-Board is needed, <ref refid="si5332_8h_1ae01f6fbfccb35d0dc46fb4ba3d43188ba4917b8a2f523ee00969d93e61ab71dc8" kindref="member">SI5332_CLK_SRC_CLKIN2_100M</ref> otherwise.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Frequencies that are integer divisors of 125 MHz or 100 MHz are derived directly from these; other frequencies are synthesized with the two MultiSynths, of which only two different frequencies can be active at a time. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</description>
